	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search your Chrome browsing history from Alfred using Kwel.

Configure Kwel Profile ID below using the ID copied from Kwel Settings → Alfred Integration. Add Search Kwel under Alfred Preferences → Features → Default Results → Setup fallback searches. Type a normal query and choose Search Kwel. Return opens the selected result in the same Chrome profile that searched it.

The first explicit Search Kwel invocation registers the bundled Native Messaging host if needed; import alone does not install it. No keyword, hotkey, profile chooser, or terminal command is required.</string>
